file constel/README.md kept synced — the exchange rung, run block, Status, Kin, and the AMUS5–AMUS6 road-on
recommend keep-going — AMUS4 GREEN and ready to send; the next agent-doable rung (AMUS5) stands a bounded in-process byte queue between the two Party views, still purely local and gate-free. AMUS6 (real Comlink socket) is the eventual check-in (Claude) point before touching seed/comlink/. No custody gate reached. Clock note: America/New_York read 20260814.044727, earlier than the prior newest 075900; the one-clock monotonic law honored by stamping 080400, just after the work it follows.
